--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
UPSTREAM SOURCES
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The CSVs here are derived from public records published by Chicago Public
Schools, the City of Chicago Data Portal (under its Terms of Use), IDPH and
HRSA. Those publishers' terms govern the underlying records.

This repository does not republish third-party pages, PDFs or raw source
files, and none is covered by the licenses above. Where a project cites such
a source as evidence, it publishes the URL, access date and SHA-256 of the
copy it relied on (for example
projects/cps-space-colocation/data/source/evidence_manifest.csv); the copies
themselves are preserved privately.
